{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rediscover the lost art of cooking in a post-apocalyptic world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a time when cooking has been forgotten, take on the role of a lone chef on a quest for the ultimate dish. Travel across mysterious lands, meet delightful companions, and craft a story all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.poster.avif?t=1754030440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.webm?t=1754030440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.mp4?t=1754030440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wield kitchen tools as weapons in side-scrolling action battles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against dynamic enemies and bosses that change with the day-night cycle. Cook meals to grow stronger, or learn powerful new skills from fellow adventurers you encounter. Make the most of every resource to defeat foes and uncover rare, high-value ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/0d19688afe82096362e63abd1e30a6c6.poster.avif?t=1754030440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/0d19688afe82096362e63abd1e30a6c6.webm?t=1754030440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/0d19688afe82096362e63abd1e30a6c6.mp4?t=1754030440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A fiery feast awaits at every campsite.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the unforgiving wilderness, nothing is more important than a hearty meal. Use your hunted ingredients to whip up gourmet meals\u2014or surprising creations you never expected. Explore every hidden corner and uncover rare recipes hidden off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.poster.avif?t=1754030440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.webm?t=1754030440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.mp4?t=1754030440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your choices shape the story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bond with charming characters over shared meals and heartfelt conversations. Your decisions impact relationships\u2014some will blossom, others may fall apart. Every choice opens new narrative paths, making each playthrough a unique experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3280150?t=1754030440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/1154e960f67697d1af4390c0cfc2bf1a9702b30f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754030440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/a35a7aadfb3779165bfd58f12e021ca504782711/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754030440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/a35a7aadfb3779165bfd58f12e021ca504782711/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754030440","categories":[{"desc